{
    "title": "OhmPlug",
    "description": "The official app to control OhmPlug smart plugs, designed to help you save energy while adding convenience to your home.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Easily set up OhmPlug smart plugs using bluetooth and Wi-Fi.\r\n\u2022 Remotely control appliances from anywhere so you don\u2019t waste energy when you\u2019re out.\r\n\u2022 Voice control your lights and entertainment.*\r\n\u2022 Give your OhmPlug a nickname (\u201cair purifier\u201d) that works with voice control.*\r\n\u2022 Create smart home routines to automate your home.*\r\n\u2022 Group your OhmPlugs based on which room they are in.\r\n\u2022 Remotely turn lights on and off while on vacation to increase home security.\r\n\r\n* Functionality is available via Amazon Echo and Google Home. You must connect your OhmPlug to your Amazon Echo or Google Home accounts. Information may be shared in accordance with OhmConnect\u2019s Privacy Policy at https://www.ohmconnect.com/privacy-policy.\r\n\r\nYou may also use OhmPlug smart plugs to get paid for saving energy in conjunction with OhmConnect, a free service that you can sign up for at ohmconnect.com.*\r\n\u2022 Set up your OhmConnect account to receive timely alerts when electricity demand is spiking so you can use less when it counts.\r\n\u2022 Automatically turn off OhmPlugs to save energy and money.\r\n\u2022 Earn money and gift cards for saving energy during peak usage hours if you sign up for OhmConnect.\r\n\r\nTo get paid for saving energy, sign up for OhmConnect\u2019s demand response program and link your utility account here: ohmconnect.com\r\n\r\nIf you join OhmConnect\u2019s demand response program, your OhmPlug will automatically turn off during OhmConnect energy-savings events for your area unless you program your OhmPlug through the App to remain on or you use your OhmConnect account to opt your OhmPlug out of a specific event.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The official app to control OhmPlug smart plugs, designed to help you save energy while adding convenience to your home.<br><br>\u2022 Easily set up OhmPlug smart plugs using bluetooth and Wi-Fi.<br>\u2022 Remotely control appliances from anywhere so you don\u2019t waste energy when you\u2019re out.<br>\u2022 Voice control your lights and entertainment.*<br>\u2022 Give your OhmPlug a nickname (\u201cair purifier\u201d) that works with voice control.*<br>\u2022 Create smart home routines to automate your home.*<br>\u2022 Group your OhmPlugs based on which room they are in.<br>\u2022 Remotely turn lights on and off while on vacation to increase home security.<br><br>* Functionality is available via Amazon Echo and Google Home. You must connect your OhmPlug to your Amazon Echo or Google Home accounts. Information may be shared in accordance with OhmConnect\u2019s Privacy Policy at https://www.ohmconnect.com/privacy-policy.<br><br>You may also use OhmPlug smart plugs to get paid for saving energy in conjunction with OhmConnect, a free service that you can sign up for at ohmconnect.com.*<br>\u2022 Set up your OhmConnect account to receive timely alerts when electricity demand is spiking so you can use less when it counts.<br>\u2022 Automatically turn off OhmPlugs to save energy and money.<br>\u2022 Earn money and gift cards for saving energy during peak usage hours if you sign up for OhmConnect.<br><br>To get paid for saving energy, sign up for OhmConnect\u2019s demand response program and link your utility account here: ohmconnect.com<br><br>If you join OhmConnect\u2019s demand response program, your OhmPlug will automatically turn off during OhmConnect energy-savings events for your area unless you program your OhmPlug through the App to remain on or you use your OhmConnect account to opt your OhmPlug out of a specific event.",
